README
------

* BinarySearchArray.java
  demonstrates how to find a value in a sorted array using built-in method 
  binarySearch()

* FillArray.java
  demonstrates how to fill an array with identical values, entirely

* FillArrayPartly.java
  demonstrates how to partly fill an array with identical values

* SortedArray.java
  demonstrates how to sort an array in ascending order using the built-in 
  method sort()

* LinkedListOperations.java
  demonstrates how to add, update, and remove entries from a data set
  organized as a linked list
  
* LinkedListSortAscending.java
  demonstrates how to sort a linked list in ascending order
  
* LinkedListSortDescending.java
  demonstrates how to sort a linked list in descending order

* LinkedListSortDescendingCollections.java
  demonstrates how to sort a linked list in descending order using the
  reverse method from the Collections module

* LinkedListSortDescendingLambda.java
  demonstrates how to sort a linked list in descending order using a 
  lambda expression
  
